        "",
        "[Verse 1]",
        "Will you never dream again?",
        "Are you afraid of tomorrow?",
        "Have you truly given up?",
        "The sky's so beautiful, it's almost ridiculous.",
        "",
        "[Verse 2]",
        "\"You can't see it anymore, not now.\"",
        "That guy's changed a lot, hasn't he?",
        "The days we shared in laughter",
        "I'm remembering things like a fool",
        "",
